# Lean: running in circles (left, right), a slalom, walking in a circle (no lean), running and walking
# up and down a 27 degree slope; an npc running a path. Behind the hero for the turns, the side for slopes
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_IN1_26   # the flat floor in Xardas' tower
cam follow 350 120 180
walkmode run
wait 500
rec left
hold forward 4000
hold turnl 4000
wait 4000
stop
wait 800
rec right
hold forward 4000
hold turnr 4000
wait 4000
stop
wait 800
rec slalom
hold forward 4800
hold turnl 800
wait 800
hold turnr 1600
wait 1600
hold turnl 1600
wait 1600
hold turnr 800
wait 800
stop
wait 800
walkmode walk
rec walk
hold forward 4000
hold turnl 4000
wait 4000
stop
walkmode run
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_05
wait 500
face uphill
cam follow 260 60 90
wait 300
rec up
hold forward 3000
wait 3000
stop
wait 500
face downhill
wait 300
rec down
hold forward 3000
wait 3000
stop
walkmode walk
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_05
wait 500
face uphill
wait 300
rec walkup
hold forward 4000
wait 4000
stop
